  "title": "MoonSmp",
  "description": "Moon SMP is a Minecraft server with a thriving economy and fun twists that can change combat and regular gameplay.",
  "body": "# <font color=\"#5b9bd5\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/1011266150052671569.webp?size=160\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Moon SMP</b></font>\n\nMoon SMP is a custom SMP experience built around competitive PvP, a stable economy, and top notch plugins — designed to give every player a fresh and intense survival experience from day one.\n\n# <font color=\"#f5c842\"><img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/60.%20Interface/71.%20Books/Book_Yellow.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Features</b></font>\n\n- <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/40.%20Weapons/5.%20Minecraft%20Dungeons/Sword_Diamond.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Custom PvP</b> — Unpredictable combat mechanics designed to keep fights exciting\n- <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/10.%20Items/36.%20Other/Shield.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Raiding & Defense</b> — Attack rival bases or fortify your own to protect your wealth\n- <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/10.%20Items/33.%20Bundles/green_bundle.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Economy System</b> — Stable and rewarding activity-based progression\n- <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/40.%20Weapons/40.%20Lodestone/Soul.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Competitive Progression</b> — Rise through the ranks by outplaying and outsmarting everyone else\n- <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/80.%20Particles/goldheart_2.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Custom SMP Twists</b> — Unique gameplay mechanics you won't find anywhere else\n\n# <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/60.%20Interface/71.%20Books/Book_Indigo.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Server Info</b>\n\n- <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/10.%20Items/20.%20Compass/Compass_12.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> Version: <b>1.20 → 1.21.1</b>\n- <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/10.%20Items/34.%20Uncategorized/Heart_Of_The_Sea.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> Region: <b>Europe</b>\n- <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/60.%20Interface/71.%20Books/Book_Black.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> Platform: <b>Java</b>\n\n# <img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/60.%20Interface/71.%20Books/Book_Aqua.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>How To Join</b>\n\nLaunch Minecraft Java Edition, open the Multiplayer menu, click Add Server, and enter our server IP.\n\n<img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/60.%20Interface/30.%20Icons/Arrow_Right_Curved.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> Connect at — <kbd>play.moonsmp.fun</kbd>\n\n# <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/1416789076912242781.webp?size=160\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> <b>Discord</b>\n\nJoin our community, get support, and stay updated on everything <font color=\"#5b9bd5\"><b>Moon SMP</b></font>.\n\n<img src=\"https://ccvaults.com/assets/60.%20Interface/30.%20Icons/Arrow_Right_Curved.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> Join at — <kbd>discord.gg/moonsmp</kbd>\n\n<iframe src=\"https://discord.com/widget?id=1063123986537525298&theme=dark\" width=\"260\" height=\"380\" allowtransparency=\"true\" frameborder=\"0\" sandbox=\"allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-same-origin allow-scripts\"></iframe>",
